// Composite unit visuals (M5 art pass, in-engine stand-in for the Blender
// pipeline — TECH_NOTES A34). Each part: size (w,h,d), offset = part center
// with y measured up from the ground, role:
//   Body     — desaturated structure color
//   Dark     — darker accents (legs, helmets, tracks, frames)
//   Emissive — essence seams (player: affinity color / enemy: red marker)
// Units without a recipe fall back to the single-cuboid look.
